    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save the world that\u2019s in crisis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But wait, the hero is a little strange\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How does he defeat the villains?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hero\u2019s method is none other than \u201c<strong>mini-games</strong>\u201d!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every battle with monsters is decided through mini-games!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat the monsters with a variety of mini-games and save the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773940/extras/61ae4613b247d48b7361dc4756935185.avif?t=1750445209\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll have to use a lot of keys! Four keys, to be exact!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up! Down! Left! Right! You\u2019ll solve everything with these!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773940/extras/4c352d2d29a8c29e9b23a26a86ceccb4.avif?t=1750445209\" width=192 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer four stages and make your way to the Demon Castle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773940/extras/f5927fa9bcbc9c1a4b1b9f0ee7a6c870.avif?t=1750445209\" data-has-big width=800 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">Warning: This process may cause a lot of frustration.</span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playing solo isn\u2019t nearly as fun.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>the real fun starts when you play with friends.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u300aMini Game Hero\u300b</strong> is a casual game where you defeat monsters through a variety of fast-paced mini-games.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save the world that\u2019s in crisis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But wait, the hero is a little strange\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How does he defeat the villains?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hero\u2019s method is none other than \u201c<strong>mini-games</strong>\u201d!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every battle with monsters is decided through mini-games!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat the monsters with a variety of mini-games and save the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773940/extras/61ae4613b247d48b7361dc4756935185.avif?t=1750445209\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll have to use a lot of keys! Four keys, to be exact!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up! Down! Left! Right! You\u2019ll solve everything with these!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773940/extras/4c352d2d29a8c29e9b23a26a86ceccb4.avif?t=1750445209\" width=192 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer four stages and make your way to the Demon Castle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773940/extras/f5927fa9bcbc9c1a4b1b9f0ee7a6c870.avif?t=1750445209\" data-has-big width=800 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">Warning: This process may cause a lot of frustration.</span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playing solo isn\u2019t nearly as fun.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>the real fun starts when you play with friends.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u300aMini Game Hero\u300b</strong> is a casual game where you defeat monsters through a variety of fast-paced mini-games.</p>",
    "short_description": "Mini Game Hero is a fast-paced casual game where every monster battle is decided by a mini-game.Use only four directional keys to attack, dodge, and react! Conquer five stages, defeat the Demon King, and save the world. With dozens of short, creative mini-games and quirky enemies.",
